            "review_title": "Review at Dear Bar",
            "review_text": "FarAway24433977442\n2 contributions\n0\nNot recommended.\nNov 2025 • Friends\nUnfortunately not really recommended. Access is via a steep underground car park access when the hotel to which the bar belongs is closed. Four young ladies stood unmotivated behind the counter. The price of gin and tonic, for example, was surprisingly high, but the amount was very small. There was very good live music, which one would have liked to enjoy if not said young ladies had been talking loudly with a few young men at the bar. It's too bad.\nRead more\nTranslated from German\nShow original\nWritten November 29, 2025",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-15",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
            "feature_depth_status": "Schema-Full-Features-Validated"
