            "review_title": "Review at Dear Bar",
            "review_text": "Ian B\n28 contributions\n0\nTrendy speak easy with lively staff\nOct 2024 • Couples\nLovely speak easy bar. Great cocktails and some nice quirky bits based on its Post office theme —You can send a txt to invite someone or yourself on a certain day or fill in a short quiz and post it and they will come up with a cocktail for you. Staff very friendly and came round and had some free shots with us. Lovely staff\nWritten October 20, 2024",
