            "review_title": "Review at Dear Bar",
            "review_text": "Rachel N\nAtlanta, Georgia1 contribution\n0\nLive music\nNov 2023 • Friends\nGreat spot to get some drinks with friend. Hidden spot in the buiding with teeny balcony, and cozy seated table\nCame across when they had a live acoustic band performing ( weekend events), we also got a personalized drink based off a little mail card we could write what we would like in the drink. Then sent it to the bartender, and they created one for our special request.\n\nPretty good experience and obviously a memorable part of our trip to Saigon..\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten November 6, 2023",
